      "filename": "Suffragette cartoon by L.M. Glackens.jpg",
      "title": "File:Suffragette cartoon by L.M. Glackens.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/Suffragette_cartoon_by_L.M._Glackens.jpg",
